cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PKAgent, please cite the software and the PKPy2 estimation engine it uses."
title: "PKAgent"
type: software
version: 2.0.0.dev0
abstract: >-
  An LLM agent that develops population pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic models with the PKPy2 estimation
  engine. The language model works only through tool calls and computes no numbers itself; PKPy2 fits every model,
  and every LLM turn and tool call is logged.
authors:
  - family-names: "Kong"
    given-names: "Hyunseung"
    affiliation: "Interdisciplinary Program in Bioinformatics, Seoul National University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gumgo91/PKAgent"
url: "https://github.com/Gumgo91/PKAgent"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - population pharmacokinetics
  - PopPK
  - PK/PD
  - nonlinear mixed effects
  - large language model
  - agent
  - tool calling
